00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:27,808
I'll be honored to stand with the people of New Hampshire shoulder to shoulder in that work, and I'll work with anyone who can deliver a better life for Granite Staters,
能够与新罕布什尔州人民并肩承担这项工作，是我的荣幸；我会与任何能为本州居民带来更好生活的人合作，

